`growth_artifact_diagnostics` 1.416 + `decay_artifact_diagnostics` 1.416 + `causality_check` 1.079 + `bulk_operator_by_regime` 0.851 + `reciprocal_traction_root_effect` 0.845 + `kernel_pole_locations` 0.762 + `dissipation_origin` 0.325 + `kernel_propagation_residuals` 0.316 + `root_power_source` 0.247 + `root_stability_class` 0.245 + `permeable_dissipative_by_regime_and_parity` 0.202 + … ≈ **9 MB**.

